%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c1a70fcd7e8f8c42920e122a812509f, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  dialogues:
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Little stars lit every fork in the fog. As the wagon safely cleared
        the forest, Mocha pointed toward the black market.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC548\uAC1C \uC18D \uAC08\uB9BC\uAE38\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uC791\uC740
        \uBCC4\uBE5B\uC774 \uCF1C\uC84C\uB2E4. \uC218\uB808\uAC00 \uBB34\uC0AC\uD788
        \uC232\uC744 \uBE60\uC838\uB098\uAC00\uC790 \uBAA8\uCE74\uB294 \uC554\uC2DC\uC7A5
        \uCABD\uC744 \uAC00\uB9AC\uCF30\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: -8000596390684728517, guid: 607807caba3f0d540925c77c91b174e4, type: 3}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Mocha
      dialogue: Surely I can buy the key now?
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uBAA8\uCE74"
      dialogue: "\uC774\uC81C \uC815\uB9D0 \uC5F4\uC1E0\uB97C \uC0B4 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uC9C0?"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha and Lune set the finished scrolls on the counter. The merchant
        smiled in satisfaction.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uC640 \uB8EC\uC740 \uC644\uC131\uD55C \uC8FC\uBB38\uC11C\uB97C
        \uB178\uC810\uC5D0 \uC62C\uB838\uB2E4. \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uB9CC\uC871\uC2A4\uB7FD\uAC8C
        \uC6C3\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: Excellent. Thanks to you, all the cargo arrived.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uD6CC\uB96D\uD574. \uB355\uBD84\uC5D0 \uC9D0\uC774 \uBAA8\uB450
        \uB3C4\uCC29\uD588\uC5B4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Even after the final payout, the key's price had risen again.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB9C8\uC9C0\uB9C9 \uC815\uC0B0\uAE08\uC744 \uBC1B\uC558\uC9C0\uB9CC
        \uC5F4\uC1E0\uAC12\uC740 \uB610 \uC62C\uB77C \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: "Here's your pay. Save a little more for the key and\u2026"
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uC218\uACE0\uBE44\uB294 \uC5EC\uAE30. \uC5F4\uC1E0\uB294 \uC870\uAE08
        \uB354 \uBAA8\uC544 \uC624\uBA74\u2026"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: As Mocha froze, Lune quietly raised her wand.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00 \uAD73\uC5B4\uC9C0\uB294 \uC606\uC5D0\uC11C \uB8EC\uC774
        \uC870\uC6A9\uD788 \uC9C0\uD321\uC774\uB97C \uB4E4\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: A violet flash turned the merchant into a small cat. A startled meow
        escaped her oversized hood.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBCF4\uB78F\uBE5B\uC774 \uBC88\uCA4D\uC774\uC790 \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC774
        \uC791\uC740 \uACE0\uC591\uC774\uB85C \uBCC0\uD588\uB2E4. \uD5D0\uB801\uD55C
        \uD6C4\uB4DC \uC548\uC5D0\uC11C \uB2F9\uD669\uD55C \uC6B8\uC74C\uC774 \uD130\uC84C\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 383150834362951310, guid: a216e9652b07ec141ae853211a65f2c0, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Lune
      dialogue: Want to change back? Then hand over the key.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB8EC"
      dialogue: "\uC6D0\uB798\uB300\uB85C \uB3CC\uC544\uAC00\uACE0 \uC2F6\uC5B4?
        \uADF8\uB7FC \uC5F4\uC1E0\uBD80\uD130."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Lune lifted the spell, and the merchant returned to her old self.
        Sweating nervously, she offered Mocha the key.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB8EC\uC774 \uB9C8\uBC95\uC744 \uD480\uC790 \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740
        \uC6D0\uB798 \uBAA8\uC2B5\uC73C\uB85C \uB3CC\uC544\uC654\uB2E4. \uC0C1\uC778\uC740
        \uC2DD\uC740\uB540\uC744 \uD758\uB9AC\uBA70 \uBAA8\uCE74\uC5D0\uAC8C \uC5F4\uC1E0\uB97C
        \uB0B4\uBC00\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: All right, all right! Take it. We're even!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uC54C\uC558\uC5B4, \uC54C\uC558\uB2E4\uACE0! \uC774\uAC78\uB85C
        \uAC70\uB798 \uB05D\uC774\uC57C!"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Back at camp, Mocha opened the chest before all eight friends. The
        paper parcel inside was full of dried catnip. Flora's ears perked up.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC57C\uC601\uC9C0\uC5D0 \uBAA8\uC778 \uC5EC\uB35F \uCE5C\uAD6C
        \uC55E\uC5D0\uC11C \uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00 \uC0C1\uC790\uB97C \uC5F4\uC5C8\uB2E4.
        \uC885\uC774 \uAFB8\uB7EC\uBBF8 \uC548\uC5D0\uB294 \uB9D0\uB9B0 \uCEA3\uC78E\uC774
        \uAC00\uB4DD\uD588\uB2E4. \uD50C\uB85C\uB77C\uC758 \uADC0\uAC00 \uCAD1\uAE0B
        \uC130\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 7663820844486097779, guid: 2ea70b8ff1ca9a149a0cfc4624001db8, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Flora
      dialogue: It's catnip! Let me have some!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uD50C\uB85C\uB77C"
      dialogue: "\uCEA3\uC78E\uC774\uC796\uC544! \uB098\uB3C4 \uD55C \uC785\uB9CC!"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Cherry divided the catnip into eight portions. After a bite each,
        the friends flopped onto the grass one by one. Mocha fell asleep with her
        chin on the empty chest.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uCCB4\uB9AC\uAC00 \uCEA3\uC78E\uC744 \uC5EC\uB35F \uBAAB\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB098\uB204\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uD55C \uC785\uC529 \uBA39\uC740 \uCE5C\uAD6C\uB4E4\uC740
        \uD558\uB098\uB458 \uD480\uBC2D\uC5D0 \uBED7\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uBAA8\uCE74\uB3C4
        \uBE48 \uC0C1\uC790\uC5D0 \uD131\uC744 \uC5B9\uACE0 \uC7A0\uB4E4\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57b8d167555b7dd4e927a5d686a547bc, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Beside the fading fire lay an open chest and eight very sleepy friends.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uB2E5\uBD88 \uACC1\uC5D0\uB294 \uC5F4\uB9B0 \uC0C1\uC790\uC640
        \uACEF\uC544\uB5A8\uC5B4\uC9C4 \uC5EC\uB35F \uCE5C\uAD6C\uAC00 \uB0A8\uC558\uB2E4."
